    "69af492a4819ea4ba10a69c5 Description": "In the Gulf of Finland, trapped within the blockade surrounding Tarkov, lies the nuclear-powered icebreaker \"Boreas\", owned by the logistics corporation Paradigm Shipping. The exact purpose of \"Boreas\" and the cargo it carries remain unknown. \n\nIt appears that Paradigm Shipping and TerraGroup made special efforts to minimize any mention of the icebreaker in the press and keep its routes and assignments classified.",
